ConfiguratorCommandHandler ..> VisitTypeDTO
ConfiguratorCommandHandler ..> VolunteerDTO
ConfiguratorCommandHandler ..> ExcludedDatePolicy
ConfiguratorCommandHandler ..> TimeSlot
ConfiguratorCommandHandler ..> LocalDate
ConfiguratorCommandHandler ..> LocalTime
ConfiguratorCommandHandler ..> Duration
ConfiguratorCommandHandler ..> YearMonth
VolunteerCommandHandler --> VolunteerService
VolunteerCommandHandler --> FirstAccessSetup
VolunteerCommandHandler --> Printer
VolunteerCommandHandler --> PromptReader
VolunteerCommandHandler --> CommandRouter
VolunteerCommandHandler ..> MonthlyAvailability
VolunteerCommandHandler ..> VolunteerCliSupport
VolunteerCommandHandler ..> YearMonth
VolunteerCommandHandler ..> DayOfWeek
VolunteerCommandHandler ..> LocalDate
VolunteerCommandHandler ..> EnumSet
VolunteerCommandHandler ..> DateTimeFormatter
VolunteerCliSupport ..> VolunteerService
VolunteerCliSupport ..> Printer
VolunteerCliSupport ..> MonthlyAvailability
VolunteerCliSupport ..> AssignedShift
VolunteerCliSupport ..> TimeSlot
VolunteerCliSupport ..> DayOfWeek
Main ..> ConfiguratorServiceImp
Main ..> VolunteerServiceImp
Main ..> JSONPlaceRepository
Main ..> JSONVisitTypeRepository
Main ..> JSONVolunteerRepository
Main ..> JSONSettingsRepository
Main ..> JSONConfiguratorRepository
Main ..> CliApp
Main ..> ConfiguratorCommandHandler
Main ..> VolunteerCommandHandler
Main ..> FirstAccessSetup
Main ..> Printer
Main ..> PromptReader

@enduml